> build-house-style · deepseek-v4.1-flash:1017-cloud
Single-file sites now deploy like folders:

- `deployTarget` accepts a regular `.html` file and uses the static image (`internal/command/deploy.go:199`).
- `NameFromPath` drops the `.html` extension, so `my-site.html` → `my-site.localhost` (`internal/docker/helpers.go:32`).
- `BuildServedSite` serves a lone file as `index.html` (`internal/docker/site.go:76`), and `HashSource` hashes files for stale detection (`internal/docker/source.go:26`).
- Added tests for naming, deploy target detection, serving, and hashing.

`make test` passes; `make lint` reports `0 issues`.
